# Secrets of Ovens Lost (otherAreas 73): Tavnazian Safehold's Despachiaire (default 106) and Jonette (default 365), no
# scripts; the cookbook ???s of the Sacrarium (default MUSTY_OLD_MANUSCRIPTS) and Phomiuna Aqueducts (NOTHING_OUT_HERE).
# A level 75 Warrior with no CoP mission; Elderly Pursuits completed (its 517 would answer Despachiaire once this quest
# is completed). The harness clock is Friday 17:00 JST: NextConquestTally() is 1800198000. Spice Gals not completed: no
# section; Despachiaire 106, Jonette 365. Completed (a GM): Despachiaire 505 (Option 1); again (Option 1): nil, 106.
# Jonette 506, finished: begun, Prog 1; again without the cookbook: nil, 365. The Sacrarium's ???: the cookbook
# (quest:keyItem); again (held): nil, its default. Phomiuna's ??? with it: nil, its default; taken away (a GM): the
# cookbook. Jonette 508, finished: completed (Miratete's Memoirs), the cookbook taken, Wait = 1800198000. Jonette: Wait
# not below the tally: 365. Two JST days on (Sunday: the tally is still 1800198000): 365. One more (Monday: the tally
# moves a week on): Despachiaire, completed: nil, 106; Jonette 507, finished: begun again (status completed), Prog 1.
# The cookbook (a GM), Jonette 508: the Memoirs are rare and held: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED, quest:complete fails, the
# cookbook kept, Wait unchanged, Prog 1 kept.
lists TavnazianSafehold/Despachiaire/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/Jonette/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/505 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/506 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/507 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/508 Sacrarium/qm_tavnazian_cookbook/onTrigger PhomiunaAqueducts/qm_tavnazian_cookbook/onTrigger
char zone=TavnazianSafehold pos=112.7,-40,-85.5 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.ElderlyPursuits completed
login
trigger Despachiaire                    # Spice Gals not completed: no section; 106
finish
warp -68.5,-11.3,9.2 TavnazianSafehold
trigger Jonette                         # no section; 365
finish
quest Sandoria.SpiceGals completed      # a GM
warp 112.7,-40,-85.5 TavnazianSafehold
trigger Despachiaire                    # available, Option 0: 505
finish                                  # Option 1
trigger Despachiaire                    # Option 1: nil; 106
finish
warp -68.5,-11.3,9.2 TavnazianSafehold
trigger Jonette                         # Option 1: 506
finish                                  # begun; Prog 1
trigger Jonette                         # Prog 1, no cookbook: nil; 365
finish
warp 13.2,-4,99.2 Sacrarium
trigger qm_tavnazian_cookbook           # the cookbook
trigger qm_tavnazian_cookbook           # held: nil; MUSTY_OLD_MANUSCRIPTS
warp 115,-26,91.6 PhomiunaAqueducts
trigger qm_tavnazian_cookbook           # held: nil; NOTHING_OUT_HERE
delkeyitem TavnazianCookbook            # a GM
trigger qm_tavnazian_cookbook           # the cookbook
warp -68.5,-11.3,9.2 TavnazianSafehold
trigger Jonette                         # the cookbook: 508
finish                                  # completed; the Memoirs; the cookbook taken; Wait 1800198000
trigger Jonette                         # Wait = the tally: no section; 365
finish
wait jst=2                              # Sunday: the tally is still 1800198000
trigger Jonette                         # no section; 365
finish
wait jst=1                              # Monday: the tally 1800802800
warp 112.7,-40,-85.5 TavnazianSafehold
trigger Despachiaire                    # completed: nil; 106
finish
warp -68.5,-11.3,9.2 TavnazianSafehold
trigger Jonette                         # Option 0, completed: 507
finish                                  # begun again (status completed); Prog 1
keyitem TavnazianCookbook               # a GM
trigger Jonette                         # 508
finish                                  # the Memoirs held (rare): not completed; the cookbook kept
trigger Jonette                         # Prog 1 kept, the cookbook: 508
finish                                  # still held: not completed
